    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="70">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 70</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="70" corresp="#wit-e"><pb n="118" ed="#liebermann"/>CXIIII. Æt twyhyndum<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="33" target="#Ine_70.lnote.oe.33"/> were mon sceal sellan<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="34" target="#Ine_70.lnote.oe.34"/> to monbote XXX scill.<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="34a" target="#Ine_70.lnote.oe.34a"/>, æt VIhyndu<hi rend="italic">m<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="35" target="#Ine_70.lnote.oe.35"/></hi> LXXX<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="36" target="#Ine_70.lnote.oe.36"/> scill., æt XIIhyndu<hi rend="italic">m<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="37" target="#Ine_70.lnote.oe.37"/></hi> CXX scill.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="70" corresp="#wit-ot-frags"><pb n="118" ed="#liebermann"/>Æ....m were ...., æt syx .....ll'.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="70" corresp="#wit-h"><pb n="118" ed="#liebermann"/>CXIIII. Æt twyhyndum were mon<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="1" target="#Ine_70.lnote.oe.1"/> sceal syllan<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="7" target="#Ine_70.lnote.oe.7"/> to monbote<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="8" target="#Ine_70.lnote.oe.8"/> XXX scll', æt syxhyndum LXXX scll', æt XIIhyndum CXX scll'.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="70" corresp="#wit-b-no-prol"><pb n="119" ed="#liebermann"/>Be twyhindu<hi rend="italic">m</hi> were. Æt twyhundum<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="2" target="#Ine_70.lnote.oe.2"/> were man sceal syllan to monbote XXX scill', ⁊ æt syxhyndu<hi rend="italic">m</hi> hundeahtatig scill', æt twelfhyndum hundtwelftig.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="70" corresp="#wit-q"><pb n="119" ed="#liebermann"/>De<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="19" target="#Ine_70.lnote.oe.19"/> tƿyhindi<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="20" target="#Ine_70.lnote.oe.20"/> hominis wera debent<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="21" target="#Ine_70.lnote.oe.21"/> reddi XXX solidi ad manbotam, de sixhindo<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="22" target="#Ine_70.lnote.oe.22"/> LXXX sol.<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="23" target="#Ine_70.lnote.oe.23"/> debent<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="24" target="#Ine_70.lnote.oe.24"/> reddi, de duodecimhindo<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="25" target="#Ine_70.lnote.oe.25"/> centum XX sol.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#attenborough" corresp="#wit-e"><pb n="58" ed="#attenborough"/>[Be twyhindum were.] Æt twyhyndum were mon sceal sellan to monbote XXX scill., æt VI hyndum LXXX scill., æt XII hyndum CXX scill.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#jurasinski-and-oliver" n="71" corresp="#wit-e"><pb n="430" ed="#jurasinski-and-oliver"/>{CXIIII} Æt twyhyndum were mon sceal sellan to monbote XXX sciƚƚ, æt VI hyndum LXXX sciƚƚ, æt XII hyndum CXX sciƚƚ.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann"><pb n="119" ed="#liebermann"/>Als<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="1" target="#Ine_70.lnote.de.1"/> Mannbusse<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="2" target="#Ine_70.lnote.de.2"/> soll man [dem Herrn des Erschlagenen] bei 200 [Schilling] Wergeld<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="3" target="#Ine_70.lnote.de.3"/> [des letzteren] 30 Schill. zahlen, bei 600 [Schilling Wergeld] 80 Schill., bei 1200: 120 Schill.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">As man-compensation one is to pay [the lord of the slain man] 30 shillings in the case of a 200 [shilling] wergeld [of the latter], 80 shillings in the case of 600 [shillings’ wergeld], 120 shillings in the case of 1200.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#attenborough" corresp="#wit-e"><pb n="59" ed="#attenborough"/>When a wergeld of 200 shillings has to be paid, a compensation of 30 shillings shall be paid to the man's lord<ptr type="editorNote" n="1" target="#Ine_70.attnote.n.1"/>; when a wergeld of 600 shillings has to be paid, the compensation shall be 80 shillings; when a wergeld of 1200 shillings has to be paid, the compensation shall be 120 shillings.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#whitelock"><pb n="407" ed="#whitelock"/>For a man of a two-hundred wergild there is to be paid a compensation to the lord of 30 shillings; for a man of a six-hundred wergild, 80 shillings; for a man of a twelve-hundred wergild, 120 shillings.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#jurasinski-and-oliver" corresp="#wit-e"><pb n="431" ed="#jurasinski-and-oliver"/>For a person whose <hi rend="italic">wer</hi> is 200 [the slayer] must give 30 shillings as man-price [to the lord of the slain man]; for [a person of] 600, 80 shillings, for [a person of] 1,200, 120 shillings.</ab>
        <note type="comparison" source="#jurasinski-and-oliver" n="431"><label>related (Attenborough)</label> <ref target="clause:Abt_6">Abt 6</ref> <quote>Attenborough relates the manbot [...] to the drihtinbeag [...] of 50 shillings due the king in Æthelberht §12 [L6].</quote></note>
        <note type="comparison" source="#jurasinski-and-oliver" n="431"><label>compare</label> <ref target="clause:Ine_76">Ine 76</ref> <quote>Compare also §78.</quote></note>
        <note type="comparedBy" source="#wormald-mel" n="280"><ref target="clause:Af_10">Af 10</ref></note>
        <note type="comparedBy" source="#wormald-mel" n="280"><ref target="clause:Af_18-1">Af 18.1–18.3</ref></note>
        <note type="comparedBy" source="#wormald-mel" n="280"><ref target="clause:Af_29">Af 29–31</ref></note>
        <note type="comparedBy" source="#wormald-mel" n="280"><ref target="clause:Af_39">Af 39–39.2</ref></note>
        <note type="comparedBy" source="#wormald-mel" n="280"><ref target="clause:Af_40">Af 40</ref></note>
        <note type="comparedBy" source="#jurasinski-and-oliver" n="437"><ref target="clause:Ine_76">Ine 76</ref></note>
        <note type="liebermannNote" subtype="textual" xml:id="Ine_70.lnote.oe.2" n="2" source="#liebermann"><bibl><biblScope unit="volume">1</biblScope><biblScope unit="page">119</biblScope></bibl><seg type="original" xml:lang="de"><hi rend="italic">im</hi> 16. <hi rend="italic">Jh. geänd. in</hi> -hyn-</seg><seg type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude">altered in the 16th cent. to -hyn-</seg></note>
        <note type="liebermannNote" subtype="textual" xml:id="Ine_70.lnote.oe.19" n="19" source="#liebermann"><bibl><biblScope unit="volume">1</biblScope><biblScope unit="page">119</biblScope></bibl><seg type="original" xml:lang="de">Te <hi rend="italic">R</hi></seg><seg type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude">Te R</seg></note>
        <note type="liebermannNote" subtype="textual" xml:id="Ine_70.lnote.oe.20" n="20" source="#liebermann"><bibl><biblScope unit="volume">1</biblScope><biblScope unit="page">119</biblScope></bibl><seg type="original" xml:lang="de"><hi rend="italic">so R;</hi> twih. <hi rend="italic">übrige</hi></seg><seg type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude">thus R; twih. the others</seg></note>
        <note type="liebermannNote" subtype="textual" xml:id="Ine_70.lnote.oe.21" n="21" source="#liebermann"><bibl><biblScope unit="volume">1</biblScope><biblScope unit="page">119</biblScope></bibl><seg type="original" xml:lang="de">debet <hi rend="italic">M Hk</hi></seg><seg type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude">debet M Hk</seg></note>
        <note type="liebermannNote" subtype="textual" xml:id="Ine_70.lnote.oe.22" n="22" source="#liebermann"><bibl><biblScope unit="volume">1</biblScope><biblScope unit="page">119</biblScope></bibl><seg type="original" xml:lang="de">-di <hi rend="italic">K Co</hi></seg><seg type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude">-di K Co</seg></note>
        <note type="liebermannNote" subtype="textual" xml:id="Ine_70.lnote.oe.23" n="23" source="#liebermann"><bibl><biblScope unit="volume">1</biblScope><biblScope unit="page">119</biblScope></bibl><seg type="original" xml:lang="de"><hi rend="italic">fehlt T M Hk</hi></seg><seg type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude">lacking in T M Hk</seg></note>
        <note type="liebermannNote" subtype="textual" xml:id="Ine_70.lnote.oe.24" n="24" source="#liebermann"><bibl><biblScope unit="volume">1</biblScope><biblScope unit="page">119</biblScope></bibl><seg type="original" xml:lang="de">debent <hi rend="italic">bis</hi> CXX sol. <hi rend="italic">überspringt Lond</hi></seg><seg type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude">debent to CXX sol. skipped by Lond</seg></note>
        <note type="liebermannNote" subtype="textual" xml:id="Ine_70.lnote.oe.25" n="25" source="#liebermann"><bibl><biblScope unit="volume">1</biblScope><biblScope unit="page">119</biblScope></bibl><seg type="original" xml:lang="de">twelfhindo <hi rend="italic">Hn</hi> 69, 2</seg><seg type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude">twelfhindo Hn 69, 2</seg></note>
        <note type="liebermannNote" subtype="textual" xml:id="Ine_70.lnote.oe.1" n="1" source="#liebermann"><bibl><biblScope unit="volume">1</biblScope><biblScope unit="page">118</biblScope></bibl><seg type="original" xml:lang="de">o <hi rend="italic">geänd. in</hi> a</seg><seg type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude">o altered to a</seg></note>
        <note type="liebermannNote" subtype="textual" xml:id="Ine_70.lnote.oe.7" n="7" source="#liebermann"><bibl><biblScope unit="volume">1</biblScope><biblScope unit="page">118</biblScope></bibl><seg type="original" xml:lang="de">y <hi rend="italic">auf Rasur</hi></seg><seg type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude">y on an erasure</seg></note>
        <note type="liebermannNote" subtype="textual" xml:id="Ine_70.lnote.oe.8" n="8" source="#liebermann"><bibl><biblScope unit="volume">1</biblScope><biblScope unit="page">118</biblScope></bibl><seg type="original" xml:lang="de"><hi rend="italic">geänd. in</hi> manb.</seg><seg type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude">altered to manb.</seg></note>
        <note type="liebermannNote" subtype="textual" xml:id="Ine_70.lnote.oe.33" n="33" source="#liebermann"><bibl><biblScope unit="volume">1</biblScope><biblScope unit="page">118</biblScope></bibl><seg type="original" xml:lang="de">twyhin. <hi rend="italic">So</hi></seg><seg type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude">twyhin. So</seg></note>
        <note type="liebermannNote" subtype="textual" xml:id="Ine_70.lnote.oe.34" n="34" source="#liebermann"><bibl><biblScope unit="volume">1</biblScope><biblScope unit="page">118</biblScope></bibl><seg type="original" xml:lang="de">syl. <hi rend="italic">So Ld</hi></seg><seg type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude">syl. So Ld</seg></note>
        <note type="liebermannNote" subtype="textual" xml:id="Ine_70.lnote.oe.34a" n="34a" source="#liebermann"><bibl><biblScope unit="volume">1</biblScope><biblScope unit="page">118</biblScope></bibl><seg type="original" xml:lang="de">⁊ <hi rend="italic">fügt zu Ld</hi></seg><seg type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude">⁊ added by Ld</seg></note>
        <note type="liebermannNote" subtype="textual" xml:id="Ine_70.lnote.oe.35" n="35" source="#liebermann"><bibl><biblScope unit="volume">1</biblScope><biblScope unit="page">118</biblScope></bibl><seg type="original" xml:lang="de">syxh. <hi rend="italic">So Ld</hi></seg><seg type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude">syxh. So Ld</seg></note>
        <note type="liebermannNote" subtype="textual" xml:id="Ine_70.lnote.oe.36" n="36" source="#liebermann"><bibl><biblScope unit="volume">1</biblScope><biblScope unit="page">118</biblScope></bibl><seg type="original" xml:lang="de">eahtatig <hi rend="italic">Ld</hi></seg><seg type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude">eahtatig Ld</seg></note>
